%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Marco_Kitchen_Confrontation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: Player
    text: This was in your walk-in fridge. Your knife rack seems to be missing a
      piece too. Care to elaborate?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Marco
    text: I-I didn't put that there. I swear.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Then who did? This is your kitchen, you are in charge.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Marco
    text: "I don't know! I found it this morning and panicked, I hid it, I didn't
      know what else to do\u2013"
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Hiding evidence makes you look more guilty, not less
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Marco
    text: I wasn't protecting myself. I was protecting her.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Her?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Marco
    text: ...
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Where do you stay?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
